Unchanged original PC card-gallery GIF for [[Let The Wookiee Win (PC Errata)]], known by [https://web.archive.org/web/20071218114834id_/http://www.swccgpc.com/cards/anewhope/ls/letthewookieewin.gif exact 18 December 2007 capture]. Native payload matches the exact CDX digest; SHA-256 <code style="overflow-wrap:anywhere;white-space:normal">7a3619a72f1c3f1c38501fbcadf0315e23e3755d0f3a71f98b2c120a561fbf56</code>. The image prints a uniqueness dot and bronze disc, and Play-on wording also documented in the 29 January 2002 supplement, page 5. Capture date is not first-publication date. Original card copyright remains printed on the image; PC gallery rendition. Used to identify and discuss historical card sources on this non-commercial fan wiki.